  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Head_items\" title=\"Category:Head items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Head.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Admiral_of_Bling\">The Admiral of Bling</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDAAFF solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#EEDDFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#3A2F45;--header-color:#DDA0DD;--header-color-dark:#773777;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\">None\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg/420px-The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"124\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg/630px-The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg/840px-The_Admiral_of_Bling_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Clothing / Helm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Head\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a>:</b> <b>Gold</b> is an expensive precious metal often used in jewellery. Unfortunately, it is very fragile, and often has low hardness.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000050000</span>50<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.50 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Special_event_items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Special event items\">Special event items</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Caypenne_Drop-axe\" title=\"Caypenne Drop-axe\">Caypenne Drop-axe</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove_loot#Hats\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove loot\">Treasure of Crystal Cove Hat Upgrades</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Scallawag%27s_Luck\" title=\"Scallawag&#39;s Luck\">Scallawag's Luck VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Scallawag%27s_Luck\" title=\"Scallawag&#39;s Luck\">Scallawag's Luck VI</a>:</b> While in Smuggler's Rest, you gain 35% additional doubloons when fighting pirates.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Crystal_Rush\" title=\"Enchantable: Crystal Rush\">Enchantable: Crystal Rush</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Crystal_Rush\" title=\"Enchantable: Crystal Rush\">Enchantable: Crystal Rush</a>:</b> This hat can be enchanted to bestow one of various benefits to nearby kobolds in Crystal Cove.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Adventuring_Bonus\" title=\"Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus\">Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Adventuring_Bonus\" title=\"Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus\">Enchantable: Adventuring Bonus</a>:</b> This hat can be enchanted to bestow one of various benefits useful in general adventuring.  Adventuring effects may change the minimum level of this item.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Skilled_Seaman\" title=\"Enchantable: Skilled Seaman\">Enchantable: Skilled Seaman</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enchantable:_Skilled_Seaman\" title=\"Enchantable: Skilled Seaman\">Enchantable: Skilled Seaman</a>:</b> This hat can be enchanted to grant a bonus to one skill.  You can have one skill bonus on a hat at a time, but can replace it with a different choice.  Skill effects may change the minimum level of this item.</span></span></li></ul></dd></dl>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:The_Admiral_of_Bling.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/The_Admiral_of_Bling.png/420px-The_Admiral_of_Bling.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"397\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/The_Admiral_of_Bling.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Flashy, ostentatious, AND completely over the top.  This pirate hat is too powerful to accept dyes, so don't even try.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<ul><li>This pirate hat is a version of the <a href=\"/page/Dread_Admiral%27s_Tricorne\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dread Admiral&#39;s Tricorne\">Dread Admiral's Tricorne</a> with a unique metallic gold color.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Obtained only from limited in-game lottery or through turning in a 2011 PAX East swag bag voucher to <a href=\"/page/Caypenne_Drop-axe\" title=\"Caypenne Drop-axe\">Caypenne Drop-axe</a> outside <a href=\"/page/The_Leaky_Dinghy\" title=\"The Leaky Dinghy\">the Leaky Dinghy</a> in the <a href=\"/page/Harbor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Harbor\">Harbor</a>.</li>\n<li>As of <a href=\"/page/Update_10_Patch_1_Release_Notes#Items\" title=\"Update 10 Patch 1 Release Notes\">update 10.1</a>, this item was changed from Bound to Account to Bound to Character.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817062924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.110 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3716/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25929/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8920/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 17/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n138.87%  128.613     48 Template:IO\n100.00%   92.611      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   92.611      1 -total\n 97.23%   90.049      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 45.96%   42.568      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.18%   41.838      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 44.23%   40.966      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.31%   40.114      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.87%   20.254      6 Template:Popup\n 17.31%   16.032      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14469-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817062924 and revision id 635284. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
